  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNFPA Moldova - Creation of an enabling environment to prevent GBV and provision of survivor-centred GBV response services</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bilateral acts. UNFPA Moldova - Funding to enhance protection, resilience, and social inclusion of Ukrainian refugees and vulnerable host communities in Moldova through strengthened Gender Based Violence (GBV) prevention and response mechanisms, improved access to life-saving sexual and reproductive health (SRH) services, and targeted support to national institutions, including the Ministry of Labour and Social Protection (MLSP) and the newly established National Agency for Preventing and Combating Violence Against Women and Domestic Violence (National Agency on EVAW).</narrative>
  </description>
